  "id": "delusion",
  "term": "delusion",
  "definition": "A delusion is a false belief, or a perception shaped by a false belief, that tends to persist and may be supported by elaborate reasoning. In older psychopathology, it is distinguished from illusion and hallucination because it centers on a fixed false belief that the person cannot recognize as false.",
